  "ruleText": "Occ 501.01 \"American Occupational Therapy Association, Inc. (AOTA)\" means the entity recognized as the national professional organization of occupational therapists and occupational therapy assistants.\n\nSource. #8275, eff 1-26-05; ss by #10282, eff 2-28-13; ss by #13678, eff 8-25-23",
